),o(\"a607862a\",\"Privacy policy\"),o(\"g5925628\",\"Contact us\"),o(\"dd6012f8\",\"Privacy center\"),o(\"f644b748\",\"Manage who can reply to your posts and your filtered replies.\"),o(\"ff4b3818\",\"Grok & Third-party Collaborators\"),o(\"i586f3e0\",\"Allow your public data as well as your interactions, inputs, and results with Grok and xAI to be used for training and fine-tuning\"),o(\"df3171d4\",\"Manage the location associated with your account\"),o(\"d8492604\",\"When selected, your posts and other account information are only visible to people who follow you.\"),o(\"if050fae\",\"Protect your videos\"),o(\"b7ed5f6e\",\"If selected, videos in your posts will not be downloadable by default. This setting applies to posts going forward and is not retroactive\"),o(\"dbb51952\",\"Protect your posts?\"),o(\"de735de6\",\"This will make them visible only to your X followers.\"),o(\"c5d4192a\",\"Protect\"),o(\"d9ddba70\",\"Communities are public, so protecting your account will hide your previous posts. You also won’t be able to post in the Community until your account is public again.\"),o(\"f527b322\",\"Protect my account\"),o(\"d165c992\",\"Anyone can tag you\"),o(\"ea339390\",\"Only people you follow can tag you\"),o(\"e3a761ee\",\"Off\"),o(\"d3a2bde8\",\"See information about your account, download an archive of your data, or learn about your account deactivation options\"),o(\"idca4742\",\"See your account information like your phone number and email address.\"),o(\"b6ded35e\",\"Change your password at any time.\"),o(\"cce24bf4\",\"Get insights into the type of information stored for your account.\"),o(\"i203df96\",\"Find out how you can deactivate your account.\"),o(\"a61ed23a\",\"Mark media you post as having material that may be sensitive\"),o(\"ae27c454\",\"When enabled, pictures and videos you post will be marked as sensitive for people who don’t want to see sensitive content.\"),o(\"fc1d217c\",\"Display media that may contain sensitive content\"),o(\"j018f2a2\",\"Explore settings\"),o(\"h1ef00dc\",\"Search settings\"),o(\"ib3357a6\",\"Personalized ads\"),o(\"f2f9628e\",\"You will always see ads on X based on your X activity. When this setting is enabled, X may further personalize ads from X advertisers, on and off X, by combining your X activity with other online activity and information from our partners.\"),o(\"b5fe50fc\",\"Ads Categories\"),o(\"c31a2ea6\",\"Enabling these settings make you eligible to see ads in these categories. Choose to see fewer ads about these categories by opting out.\"),o(\"if996630\",\"Gambling\"),o(\"a9ed7774\",\"Allow use of where you see X content across the Web\"),o(\"e2d61838\",\"This setting lets X keep track of your visits to other websites that integrate X content, such as embedded timelines. That information makes X better for you, such as by personalizing your experience. This web browsing history will never be stored with your name, email, or phone number.\"),o(\"c966aaf4\",\"These web page visits are not stored or used when you’re in certain countries.\"),o(\"e8313b32\",\"Are you sure? Once you turn this off, you can’t turn it back on while you’re in this country.\"),o(\"f1d46fd6\",\"Yes, I’m sure\"),o(\"f6c8ccc8\",\"Personalize based on your inferred identity\"),o(\"ed012c88\",\"X will always personalize your experience based on information you’ve provided, as well as the devices you’ve used to log in. When this setting is enabled, X may also personalize based on other inferences about your identity, like devices and browsers you haven’t used to log in to X or email addresses and phone numbers similar to those linked to your X account.\"),o(\"d3c20d80\",\"Allow additional information sharing with business partners\"),o(\"f1c0d09c\",\"X always shares information with business partners as a way to run and improve its products. When enabled, this allows X to share additional information with those partners to help support running X’s business, including making X’s marketing activities on other sites and apps more relevant for you.\"),o(\"dc20d918\",\"Personalize based on places you’ve been\"),o(\"af7d89e6\",\"X always uses some information, like where you signed up and your current location, to help show you more relevant content. When this setting is enabled, X may also personalize your experience based on other places you’ve been.\"),o(\"f2b23062\",\"Accessibility, display and languages\"),o(\"fa76d7dc\",\"Manage how X content is displayed to you.\"),o(\"j7a15010\",\"Manage aspects of your X experience such as limiting color contrast and motion.\"),o(\"a257ecae\",\"Manage your font size, color, and background. These settings affect all the X accounts on this browser.\"),o(\"jc3fa0e2\",\"Manage which languages are used to personalize your X experience.\"),o(\"cc2973a8\",\"Limit how X uses some of your network data on this device.\"),o(\"a4b69cbc\",\"Display language\"),o(\"c856bd00\",\"Select your preferred language for headlines, buttons, and other text from X.\"),o(\"cab61d58\",\"Select additional languages\"),o(\"dd93fafa\",\"Select additional languages for the content you want to see on X.\"),o(\"bca1de4a\",\"Additional languages you speak\"),o(\"c3aa76c4\",\"Languages you may know\"),o(\"g099069c\",\"Manage the languages X inferred based on your activity, such as the accounts you follow and the posts you engage with.\"),o(\"cf9ce876\",\"App and post languages\"),o(\"f8e46b90\",\"These are the social accounts you connected to your X account to log in. You can disable access here.\"),o(\"d84ed6b2\",\"Disconnect\"),o(\"i51130d4\",\"Google\"),o(\"e28901f2\",\"Apple\"),o(\"cf8560be\",\"Connected\"),o(\"ad31b476\",\"Manage your automated account.\"),o(\"a2981062\",\"Managing account\"),o(\"aff4540e\",\"Change managing account\"),o(\"b8b9d100\",\"Set up account automation\"),o(\"e0bc51f6\",\"Turn off account automation\"),o(\"b92190c2\",\"Managing account connected\"),o(\"fb03b39a\",\"Managing account disconnected\"),o(\"bd51ddfa\",\"We are u