count you’d like to use, enter the email address of that account when prompted for an email by Stripe. Note: your Stripe email may be different than your X email.\"),o(\"ebfb897c\",\"Examples\"),o(\"dc4feb1a\",\"Not sure what to say?\"),o(\"h9b9d486\",\"The kind of content you offer Subscribers is entirely up to you. Here are some examples to help get you started.\"),o(\"ic130fd6\",\"You’ll get some cool behind-the-scenes content, early peeks at my books and other projects, and monthly AMAs.\"),o(\"dd913e24\",\"You’re in for my hot takes, unscripted thoughts, and extra content from yours truly.\"),o(\"b737ee66\",\"Get ready for a VIP experience. Think: Subscriber-only content like polls, videos, and deals.\"),o(\"a0bb2076\",\"Keep your intro short and sweet, you’ll be able to describe your content later. Here are a few examples to help get you started.\"),o(\"fe076612\",\"Hi and welcome to my Subscriptions page! I’m so glad you’re here. Thanks for making it possible for me to do what I love.\"),o(\"g7f66daa\",\"What’s up everyone? Thanks for checking out my Subscription. I think you’ll like what I have in store for you.\"),o(\"hbe4f99e\",\"Hey there! Can’t wait to share some top secret content and get to know you even better :)\"),o(\"fb278c82\",\"What’s this preview?\"),o(\"j6cab6ec\",\"This is what people see before they Subscribe to you. Tweak and edit your descriptions until you’ve got them just right.\"),o(\"f2b1e83e\",\"Grok & Third-Party Collaborators\"),o(\"e110a46c\",\"Delete conversation history\"),o(\"ebc4fda0\",\"You’re about to delete your grok conversation history. You will not be able to access these conversations again.\"),o(\"c90fe716\",\"Do you want to delete your conversations?\"),o(\"a8d516a4\",\"X may share with xAI your X public data as well as your user interactions, inputs and results with Grok on X to train and fine-tune Grok and other AI models developed by xAI. This helps us continuously improve your user experience.\"),o(\"a127886c\",\"Allow Grok to remember your conversation history\"),o(\"f49b39b8\",\"Allow Grok to remember details from your previous conversations. You can delete individual conversations to forget the associated details.\"),o(\"b7de9ad2\",\"Allow X to personalize your experience with Grok\"),o(\"ed141096\",\"Allow your X data as well as your interactions, inputs, and results with Grok to be used for personalizing your Grok experience X may share with xAI your X data as well as your user interactions, inputs and results with Grok to personalize your experience with Grok and other AI models developed by xAI. This helps us continuously improve your user experience. \"),o(\"e6ba42de\",\"Ad Revenue Share\"),o(\"ebc16756\",\"Creator Revenue Share\"),o(\"da4cd6fa\",\"Unfortunately, you’re not yet eligible for Ads Revenue Sharing. You’ll need to meet the below requirements to participate:\"),o(\"b2961492\",\"Unfortunately, you’re not yet eligible for Creator Revenue Sharing. You’ll need to meet the below requirements to participate:\"),o(\"d3789528\",\"About Ad Rev Share\"),o(\"aa0ff456\",\"About Creator Rev Share\"),o(\"bf214f48\",\"Okay\"),o(\"g22dff11\",function(e){return\"Subscribe to \"+e.tier+\" or Verified Organizations\"}),o(\"ef8f96cc\",\"500 verified followers\"),o(\"hb4c5169\",function(e){return\"Have at least \"+e.impression_number+\"M impressions on your posts within the last 3 months\"}),o(\"f91685ba\",\"You are automatically eligible to get paid for your posts!\"),o(\"j9b82e9c\",\"As a subscriber or Verified Organization, you are automatically eligible for ads revenue sharing. Your payout is based on the number of verified impressions on ads shown in the replies to your posts.\"),o(\"e218e1b2\",\"As a subscriber or Verified Organization, you are automatically eligible for Creator revenue sharing.\"),o(\"b62df418\",\"As a subscriber, you are automatically eligible for ads revenue sharing. Your payout is based on the number of verified impressions on ads shown in the replies to your posts.\"),o(\"hd2fca54\",\"As a subscriber, you are automatically eligible for Creator revenue sharing.\"),o(\"acd1a1be\",\"Set up your payout details now to receive future payouts.\"),o(\"f7e11f70\",\"Join & Verify ID\"),o(\"c8169274\",\"There was a problem with saving your application. Please try again later.\"),o(\"c3f93665\",\"Creator Revenue Sharing Terms\"),o(\"a249ce04\",\"Ads Revenue Sharing Terms\"),o(\"d085a144\",\"Creator earnings dashboard\"),o(\"a5204850\",\"Total revenue\"),o(\"ada650cf\",function(e){return\"Pay period: \"+e.fromDate+\" - \"+e.toDate}),o(\"aa732c0a\",\"Video Ads Revenue Sharing\"),o(\"g88c1108\",\"About Video Ads Revenue Sharing\"),o(\"gd1edbdb\",function(e){return\"Subscribe to \"+e.tier+\" or Premium Business\"}),o(\"d4bb7e9c\",\"Video Ads Revenue Sharing Terms\"),o(\"dc535dbe\",\"Earn more for your content on Twitter by applying to our video pre-roll ads revenue sharing program.\"),o(\"eb6d9270\",\"Get paid for your content\"),o(\"a778472e\",\"Details:\"),o(\"bde8446e\",\"Select “Agree & submit” to apply for the ads revenue sharing program.\"),o(\"a415fd3a\",\"Agree & submit\"),o(\"fbba9725\",\"Twitter Rules\"),o(\"f3dd8c4a\",\"Ads Revenue Sharing Terms and the Creator Monetization Standards\"),o(\"bcf3a9e6\",\"Manage settings that help limit unwelcome replies.\"),o(\"c048fd3a\",\"Filter potentially unwelcome replies\"),o(\"dab7dac4\",\"Replies to your posts that contain potentially harmful or offensive language will be filtered and appear here. Others can still see these replies.\"),o(\"c4c53b86\",\"Keep in mind we use technology to help us identify such replies, so while we’re always improving, we may not get it right all the time.\"),o(\"dca3d2ee\",\"Turn off reply filter?\"),o(\"fe440ff8\",\"Filtered replies will not be restored to your posts.\"),o(\"b4f917d0\",\"Miscellaneous\"),o(\"bdfa2b8c\",\"Additional resources\"),o(\"b8692262\",\"Check out other places for helpful information to learn more about X products and services.\"),o(\"c0398892\",\"Release notes\"),o(\"b833bcde\",\"Manage aspects of your X experience such as limiting color contrast and motion. These settings affect all the X accounts on this browser.\"),o(\"d5b646be\",\"Vision\"),o(\"jfe6a3a0\",\"Motion\"),o(\"e8c72272\",\"Increase color contrast\"),o(\"dba2cdd2\",\"Improves legibility by increasing the contrast between text and background colors.\"),o(\"d070244e\",\"Reduce motion\"),o(\"icfa5e8c\",\"Limits the amount of in-app animations, including live engagement counts.\"),o(\"ae41b002\",\"Limits the amount of in-app animations, including live engagement counts. Your system is currently signaling to reduce motion. If you would like to re-enable motion, first disable it there.\"),o(\"h9d1cfae\",\"Receive image description reminder\"),o(\"c878e9f8\",\"Enables a reminder to add image descriptions before a post can be sent.\"),o(\"bbd1fc7c\",\"Learn more about accessibility at X\"),o(\"ac865cf0\",\"Accessibility at X\"),o(\"f70cd5ee\",\"Phone\"),o(\"ib6f1694\",\"Account creation\"),o(\"de323650\",\"Female\"),o(\"b6ab31be\",\"Male\"),o(\"hbd12156\",\"Request Verification\"),o(\"b7ec04f4\",\"Yes\"),o(\"f70d5780\",\"Yes.\"),o(\"dc62d3c6\",\"No.\"),o(\"a67dbd0a\",\"Parody, commentary and fan account\"),o(\"a3db727e\",\"Manage your parody, commentary and fan account\"),o(\"eacf1990\",\"Add your date of birth to your profile.\"),o(\"a3bf1262\",\"Change your date of birth on your profile.\"),o(\"h530db16\",\"Protected posts\"),o(\"d6d80990\",\"This information applies to your browser or device while you’re logged out. It may be different when you’re logged in.\"),o(\"i0d81ddb\",\"your personalization and data settings\"),o(\"g2a9bd3e\",\"Automated Account Labels\"),o(\"dd9b3aae\",\"What’s an automated account?\"),o(\"b80bdc40\",\"Automated accounts are programmed to perform certain actions automatically through the X API. Like posting a region’s weather conditions, for example. They’re created and managed by other people on X.\"),o(\"a01ac9b6\",\"Labels let the world know who’s managing the automated account. Once an automated account owner has connected their managing account, a label will appear on the automated account profile and posts.\"),o(\"b989e1fe\",\"Do I need to label my automated accounts?\"),o(\"i2d599aa\",\"How do I label my automated account?\"),o(\"gd5bed72\",\"Create a managing account\"),o(\"g6d44432\",\"A managing account is the human-run account responsible for the automated account.\"),o(\"e20a69e8\",\"Connect your managing and automated account\"),o(\"d2f88358\",\"Connect your accounts from the Automation page in your settings.\"),o(\"e427f632\",\"Your account is labeled!\"),o(\"a4d7cffa\",\"Once the accounts are connected, the automated account will have a label.\"),o(\"a18d6a7d\",\"new rules\"),o(\"e9965c14\",\"automated account label FAQ\"),o(\"ee78c192\",\"What’s a PCF account?\"),o(\"c3f35e0c\",\"A PCF account depicts another person, group, or organization in their profile to discuss, satirize, or share information about that entity.\"),o(\"d019b5fa\",\"Do I need to label my PCF account?\"),o(\"dd04f24e\",\"Yes. The PCF label ensures people on X are not confused by your account, informing them that your account is not affiliated with the subject of the profile. If not labeled, your account may violate the Authenticity policy.\"),o(\"hb0f8bbc\",\"How do I label my PCF account?\"),o(\"g69acc5c\",\"Just click ‘Got it’, and we’ll take you to your profile settings to set an account label!\"),o(\"d313d431\",\"Authenticity policy\"),o(\"a3f22d8e\",\"Select the kinds of notifications you get about your activities, interests, and recommendations.\"),o(\"bc20979a\",\"X and its partners use cookies to provide you with a better, safer, and faster service and to support our business. Some cookies are necessary to use our services, improve our services, and make sure they work properly.\"),o(\"ge06dadc\",\"Allow X and its partners to use cookies to provide you with ads and communications tailored to your interests.\"),o(\"he20de3a\",\"Don’t allow X to use cookies to gather additional data for tailored ads and communications.\"),o(\"g0ec0bec\",\"Deactivated\"),o(\"g89f4614\",\"Your account is deactivated\"),o(\"f1768324\",\"Control how X personalizes content and collects and shares certain data.\"),o(\"ja94f34e\",\"These settings apply to this browser or device while you’re logged out. They don’t have any effect when you’re logged in.\"),o(\"bd73f7e6\",\"This will enable or disable all of the settings on this page.\"),o(\"ddbc3288\",\"Data\"),o(\"ae5339a0\",\"See your X data\"),o(\"b934e0ea\",\"Disable personalization and data?\"),o(\"i0317e0e\",\"This may make the posts and ads you see less relevant.\"),o(\"a148acba\",\"Disable\"),o(\"aa023546\",\"Personalize based on the places you’ve been\"),o(\"ced77194\",\"Allow use of where you see X content across the web\"),o(\"fe1fc83e\",\"These are the age ranges associated with you.\"),o(\"bf9c74d0\",\"Do not use these age ranges for personalization.\"),o(\"cf0daa24\",\"It may take a while to gather this information. Try again later.\"),o(\"ea522535\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"hf5ca8f8\",\"profile\"),o(\"d9cbe351\",function(e){return e.count+\" login event\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"de90b04a\",\"Places you’ve been\"),o(\"cbd2ef59\",function(e){return e.count+\" location\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"e1c6b2d6\",\"Tailored audiences\"),o(\"ed19d10d\",function(e){return e.audienceCount+\" audience\"+r(e.audienceCount,\"\",\"s\")+\" from \"+e.advertiserCount+\" advertiser\"+r(e.advertiserCount,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"f00d0d03\",function(e){return e.count+\" interest\"+r(e.count,\"\",\"s\")}),o(\"hf9c2caa\",\"Request advertiser list?\"),o(\"c29b7971\",function(e){return\"This will be sent to \"+e.primaryEmail+\".\"}),o(\"b9e1cf02\",\"Request\"),o(\"a8276fac\",\"Request advertiser list\"),o(\"g7912a84\",\"Got it. Your list will be emailed once it’s ready.\"),o(\"d6104de0\",\"You can opt out of interest-ba