tificially created or virtual phone numbers, phone numbers must be from a trusted carrier.\"),o(\"j6e19c58\",\"Community Notes values\"),o(\"ea580ee2\",\"A quick reminder of the Community Notes values:\"),o(\"eac7b6ac\",\"Contribute to build understanding\"),o(\"b0381cfc\",\"Act in good faith\"),o(\"f0addddc\",\"Be helpful, even to those who disagree\"),o(\"h7c7b204\",\"Help rate existing notes before writing a new one\"),o(\"i8cae552\",\"By rating you’ll help keep quality in Community Notes high.\"),o(\"hd43a218\",\"You’ve reached your daily limit for writing notes\"),o(\"aaba8ed2\",\"To keep note quality high and prevent spam, there’s a limit to the number of notes contributors can write each day, based on their Writing Impact. Please try again later.\"),o(\"a67ed4d6\",\"You’ve reached the limit for adding notes to this author’s posts for now\"),o(\"ic484166\",\"To keep note quality high and prevent spam, there’s a limit to the number of notes one can write on a specific post author in a given time period. The limit is based on how helpful people have found one’s past notes on that author. Please try again later.\"),o(\"b98f077c\",\"Request a Note Info\"),o(\"ee691104\",\"Request a Community Note about this post\"),o(\"j825663a\",\"There’s already a proposed Collaborative Note on the post\"),o(\"f8cbdf02\",\"Think this post is potentially misleading? Request a Community Note.\"),o(\"a9c58d34\",\"You can help rate and improve it.\"),o(\"f132d1be\",\"Contributors will see alerts on posts that get enough requests\"),o(\"gf71296c\",\"If a note is written and rated helpful by other contributors, it will be shown on the post\"),o(\"de0685b4\",\"X doesn’t choose which notes show – Community Notes is by the people, for the people\"),o(\"f8ac3c88\",\"Agree & Request a note\"),o(\"b4917374\",\"Continue Requesting a Note\"),o(\"je9cfe26\",\"See Collaborative Note\"),o(\"a8edd0ea\",\"Add a source?\"),o(\"a39a0de6\",\"Link to an X post\"),o(\"j819c176\",\"Help Community Notes 