a post\"),o(\"fb59415e\",\"In order to be shown publicly as context on the post, a note needs to be rated helpful by enough people from different points of view. This approach helps avoid bias and manipulation, and helps find notes that are helpful to many people.\"),o(\"f9a44022\",\"X, the company, doesn’t choose what shows up: the people do\"),o(\"gdf4fbb2\",\"X, the company, doesn’t write, rate or moderate notes (unless they break the X Rules). We believe giving people voice to make these choices together is a fair and effective way to add information that helps people stay better informed.\"),o(\"cc720e6a\",\"Community Notes is built on data transparency\"),o(\"j2fcd33a\",\"Data includes contributions up until\"),o(\"d4a6b322\",\"All Community Notes data are published here daily, so people have free access to analyze it, identify problems, and spot opportunities to make Community Notes better. We can’t wait to learn with you.\"),o(\"c359263a\",\"Learn how to use and analyze Community Notes data \"),o(\"b8a27fe2\",\"in our guide\"),o(\"j1c99e00\",\"Notes data\"),o(\"i6f69314\",\"Ratings data\"),o(\"b7e4c114\",\"Note status history data\"),o(\"d7f19114\",\"User enrollment status data\"),o(\"ae4ebaec\",\"Got Likes Pilot ratings data\"),o(\"b6008808\",\"Note request data\"),o(\"h786cd7a\",\"Notes data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"d0fe8052\",\"Ratings data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"c0427f94\",\"Note status history data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"g880d8c0\",\"User enrollment status data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"ab1b3d38\",\"Note request data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"d6869f80\",\"Got Likes Pilot data isn’t available yet\"),o(\"c43fb933\",\"X Developer Agreement and Policy\"),o(\"h92fe1be\",\"Unfortunately, Community Notes is not available to you at this time.\"),o(\"f0dc1434\",\"Community Notes is currently only available in the U.S.\"),o(\"f87c3588\",\"Boost timelines\"),o(\"g1033d86\",\"No boosted posts\"),o(\"a6b8ddda\",\"Boost some posts to see them here\"),o(\"